# Every text file in this repository uses LF endings, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. `scripts/check.mjs` enforces the formatting policy as an error, and the
# gate runs on Windows in CI: a checkout that converted line endings to CRLF made the rule fire
# on all 145 source files, which turned a real check into a platform-specific false alarm. Pinning
# the ending here means the file on disk is the file in the repository, whichever machine cloned it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
